# SuperMemo Assistant change log. SMA shows this file after an update.

[3.1.3 / 2026-10-09]
- Fixed: SMA no longer closes when its plugins start slowly, for example on the first start after an update.

[3.1.2 / 2026-10-09]
- Fixed: Ctrl+Alt+Shift+P opens the command palette again, also while SuperMemo shows an element.
- Fixed: Windows that hotkeys open come to the front and take the keyboard focus.
- Added: A Hotkeys tab in the SMA settings, to change the hotkeys of SMA or restore their defaults.
- Fixed: Hotkeys that only work in the element window work again.
- Added: The Hotkeys tab warns when a plugin already uses a key.
- Fixed: The Books import window opens again.
- Fixed: The plugins that come with SMA are no longer marked as development plugins.
- Changed: Clearer messages, and a hint in the search box of the command palette.
- Fixed: Plugin windows and dialogs come to the front when they open.
- Fixed: "Browse plugins" no longer offers the plugins that come with SMA.
- Fixed: Plugin settings windows show the plugin name, and this change log wraps long lines.
- Removed: The Email and OmniMemo plugins, which were never finished.

[3.1.1 / 2026-10-08]
- Fixed: The license screens show the current license of this project.
- Fixed: This window lists the changes of the current versions, and its link opens the home page of this project.
- Changed: The program files, the installer, and the plugin catalog name the SMA Community as publisher.

[3.1.0 / 2026-10-07]
- Added: Command palette (Ctrl+Alt+Shift+P) to find and run the commands of SMA and of its plugins.
- Added: Books, Writing, Formulation, and Local API plugins.
- Added: PDF plugin: titles for extracts, and one extract per section of a bookmark level.
- Added: Optional Themes plugin, available from "Browse plugins". It is off until you turn it on.
- Added: "Open logs folder" in the menu of the notification-area icon.
- Changed: SMA and its plugins send no telemetry. Errors stay in the local log files.
- Changed: Releases are signed with the project's own certificate.
- Fixed: A launch hook that never returns no longer delays the next ones.
- Fixed: A Windows Search failure during setup no longer shows up as an error.

[3.0.0 / 2026-10-07]
- Added: Support for SuperMemo 20 (64-bit) on .NET 10.
- Added: The installer includes the PDF plugin. It uses the free PDFium engine and has no evaluation limits.
- Added: "Browse plugins" installs and updates plugins from the plugin feed of this project.
- Added: SMA updates itself from the GitHub Releases of this project.
- Changed: Plugins run on .NET 10 and must target SMA 3.0 or later.
- Removed: Support for SuperMemo 17 to 19.1.

Earlier versions: https://github.com/sm18lr88/SMA/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md
